---
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
---

<LegalPage
  title="Text with JimK.ai or Buddy — AIIT-THRESHOLD"
  description="How AIIT-THRESHOLD's user-initiated AI text conversations with JimK.ai or Buddy will work, including registration status, message frequency, STOP, START, HELP, and mobile privacy."
  eyebrow="Text with JimK.ai or Buddy · registration in progress"
  heading="A conversation you start. No marketing."
  lede="We are registering our conversational text service now. When it is available, you will choose JimK.ai or Buddy, start the conversation yourself, and receive automated replies from the companion you selected."
  meta="Registration in progress · Effective July 18, 2026"
>
  <div class="legal-status" role="status">
    <span class="legal-status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <div>
      <strong>Text replies are not live yet</strong>
      <p>
        Registration is in progress. Voice calls work now at
        <a href="tel:+19189184705">(918) 918-4705</a> — press 1 for JimK.ai or 2 for Buddy.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="legal-section" id="how-it-works">
    <h2>How texting will work</h2>
    <p>
      This is a one-to-one conversational service, not a subscription list. After registration
      is complete, text <strong>JIM</strong> or <strong>BUDDY</strong> to
      <strong>(918) 918-4705</strong>. Then initiate your conversation. The companion you
      selected will answer with automated AI-generated conversational replies.
    </p>
    <div class="legal-grid">
      <div class="legal-card">
        <span class="legal-card-number">01</span>
        <h3>Choose a companion</h3>
        <p>After registration is complete, text JIM or BUDDY to (918) 918-4705.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legal-card">
        <span class="legal-card-number">02</span>
        <h3>You initiate</h3>
        <p>You start the conversation. Replies are automated and come from the companion you chose.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legal-card">
        <span class="legal-card-number">03</span>
        <h3>You stay in control</h3>
        <p>Use STOP, START, or HELP at any time. Message frequency follows your conversation.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-callout" id="sms-disclosure">
    <div class="legal-kicker">SMS disclosure</div>
    <h2>What you agree to when you initiate a text</h2>
    <p>
      By texting AIIT-THRESHOLD after the service becomes available, you request and consent to
      receive <strong>user-initiated automated AI conversational replies</strong>.
      <strong>Message frequency varies. Message and data rates may apply.</strong>
    </p>
    <p>
      Reply <strong>STOP</strong> to opt out, <strong>START</strong> to opt back in, or
      <strong>HELP</strong> for help. Consent is not a condition of purchase. The service is
      conversational only; <strong>we do not send marketing text messages.</strong>
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section" id="commands">
    <h2>STOP, START, and HELP</h2>
    <div class="legal-grid">
      <div class="legal-card">
        <h3>STOP</h3>
        <p>Stops automated conversational replies to your mobile number.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legal-card">
        <h3>START</h3>
        <p>Restarts replies after you have opted out and want to begin again.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="legal-card">
        <h3>HELP</h3>
        <p>Returns service and contact information. You may also email us directly.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-section" id="privacy">
    <h2>Your mobile information stays out of marketing</h2>
    <p>
      We do not sell your mobile information or SMS consent. We do not share your mobile
      information or SMS consent with third parties or affiliates for marketing or promotional
      purposes. Operational providers may process limited information only as needed to deliver,
      secure, and support the texting service.
    </p>
    <p>
      Text content may be retained as an interaction record or retrieval memory under our
      <a href="/data-policy/">Data Policy</a>, but it is never tokenized into model training
      weights. Read our full <a href="/privacy-policy/">Privacy Policy</a> and
      <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a>.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-callout">
    <div class="legal-kicker">Available now</div>
    <h2>Prefer to talk?</h2>
    <p>
      Voice calls are live now. Call from any phone and choose the companion you want to speak
      with. Text replies will remain unavailable until registration is complete.
    </p>
    <div class="legal-actions">
      <a class="legal-button" href="tel:+19189184705">Call (918) 918-4705</a>
      <a class="legal-button secondary" href="mailto:reports@aiitcorp.com">Email for help</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
